# Events for the automatic run of graphics_test on Windows: see
# doc/auto_events.md, and tests/graphics_test.evt, whose events these are.
# The syncs are Windows's: the font list test pages through the platform's
# fonts, of which Windows has twenty pages more than the Linux desktops, so
# every pattern after it is twenty frames on.

# The real keyboard, mouse and joystick are set aside for the run
keyboardoff
mouseoff
joystickoff

# Graphical scrolling test: the arrows scroll the grid, ten steps each way
sync 166
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
enter

# Graphical mouse movement test: the mouse draws a box and a diagonal
sync 167
moumovg 1 200 200
moumovg 1 1100 200
moumovg 1 1100 700
moumovg 1 200 700
moumovg 1 200 200
moumovg 1 1100 700
enter

# View drawing scale test: zoom in twice and out once, pan left, right, up
# and down
sync 171
pagu
pagu
pagd
left
left
right
up
up
down
enter
